{"id":"bfb4dca042a4697a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md","title":"Sobolev Embedding","display":"df-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sobolev-embedding","aliases":["58-df-sobolev-embedding","Sobolev Embedding"],"display":"df-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md]]","[[58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]]","[[58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sobolev-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sobolev-embedding</span><span>Sobolev Embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635eb91d8ecbc386\" href=\"?note=635eb91d8ecbc386\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md\">../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"707325cb0230c081\" href=\"?note=707325cb0230c081\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md\">58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5a0510b115e1b59\" href=\"?note=e5a0510b115e1b59\" title=\"58-df-holder-function-space.md\">58-df-holder-function-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d47484adcb88c697\" href=\"?note=d47484adcb88c697\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le p&lt;\\infty\">\\(1\\le p&lt;\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le q\\le\\infty\">\\(1\\le q\\le\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span>；一次调用中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k,p,q,\\Omega\">\\(n,k,p,q,\\Omega\\)</span> 固定在上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 及范数使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\">\\(L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\">\\(C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\)</span>、其范数及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e5a0510b115e1b59\" href=\"?note=e5a0510b115e1b59\" title=\"./58-df-holder-function-space.md\">58-df-holder-function-space.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"707325cb0230c081\" href=\"?note=707325cb0230c081\" title=\"./58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md\">58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md</a> 定义；连续嵌入的定义本身不预设延拓算子存在。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 保留二参数接口。对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q\">\\(L^q\\)</span> 目标采用商类的规范包含；对于 Hölder 目标采用唯一连续代表元关系，而非把商类当作逐点函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>实数阶实例中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 及其范数使用 <code>58-df-fourier-sobolev-space</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\">\\(L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\\)</span>。该实例通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S\\)</span> 指定规范映射。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),L^q(\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\n\\bigl(u\\in L^q(\\Omega)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),L^q(\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\n\\bigl(u\\in L^q(\\Omega)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}holder\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists h\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S(h,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\n\\land\\|h\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}holder\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists h\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S(h,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\n\\land\\|h\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n))\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists u\\in L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists f\\in u\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,f,n)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n))\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists u\\in L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists f\\in u\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,f,n)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kp&lt;n\">\\(kp&lt;n\\)</span> 时临界指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^*=np/(n-kp)\">\\(p^*=np/(n-kp)\\)</span>；较小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的嵌入还需结合域的有限测度。</li>\n<li>Sobolev 嵌入定理给出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kp&lt;n\">\\(kp&lt;n\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^{p^*}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^{p^*}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Morrey 嵌入定理给出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kp&gt;n\">\\(kp&gt;n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=k-n/p\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\alpha=k-n/p\\in(0,1)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kp=n\">\\(kp=n\\)</span> 是临界情形，不能代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^*\">\\(p^*\\)</span> 公式，通常涉及任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、BMO 或 Trudinger–Moser 型结论。</li>\n<li>Morrey 嵌入在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-n/p\\in(0,1)\">\\(k-n/p\\in(0,1)\\)</span> 时给出这里写出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{0,\\alpha}\">\\(C^{0,\\alpha}\\)</span>；更高正则性需写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{m,\\gamma}\">\\(C^{m,\\gamma}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Rellich–Kondrachov 的紧性需要严格低于临界指数及相应域条件，不是连续嵌入定义的一部分。</li>\n<li>上述两条存在性结论是定理，已从 <code>[Assertion]</code> 移至本节；<code>[Assertion]</code> 只保留连续嵌入的范数不等式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Brezis, Functional Analysis, Sobolev Spaces and PDEs</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md","status":"resolved","id":"635eb91d8ecbc386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-holder-continuity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"707325cb0230c081","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holder-function-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d47484adcb88c697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W^{k,p}(\\Omega)$ 及范数使用 [[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]；$L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)$。$C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)$、其范数及 $\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S$ 取 [[./58-df-holder-function-space.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-holder-function-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W^{k,p}(\\Omega)$ 及范数使用 [[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]；$L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)$。$C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)$、其范数及 $\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S$ 取 [[./58-df-holder-function-space.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"707325cb0230c081","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)$ 由 [[./58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]] 定义；连续嵌入的定义本身不预设延拓算子存在。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le p<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le q\\le\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"n,k,p,q,\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L^q","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),L^q(\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\n\\bigl(u\\in L^q(\\Omega)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}holder\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(W^{k,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega))\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\;\\\\\n&\\exists h\\in C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S(h,u,\\Omega,n,\\alpha)\n\\land\\|h\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)}\\le C\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n))\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists u\\in L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\exists f\\in u\\;\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,f,n)\\land\\|u\\|_{L^q(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"kp<n","display":false},{"tex":"p^*=np/(n-kp)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"kp<n","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^{p^*}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,k,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"kp>n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=k-n/p\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"kp=n","display":false},{"tex":"p^*","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"k-n/p\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"C^{0,\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"C^{m,\\gamma}","display":false}],"bytes":3720,"backlinks":[{"id":"212cd08391c68bb4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md|58-df-sobolev-embedding]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","635eb91d8ecbc386","707325cb0230c081","e5a0510b115e1b59","d47484adcb88c697"]}